e models.\r\n- Extra options for speaker identification\r\n- Bug fixes and minor improvements.\r\n- AppImage support for Linux\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWindows, macOS and Linux AppImage installation files for the release are available on [SourceForge](https://sourceforge.net/projects/buzz-captions/files/)\r\n\r\nBuzz for Linux you can get on [Flathub](https://github.com/flathub/io.github.chidiwilliams.Buzz) and [Snap](https://snapcraft.io/buzz)   \r\n\r\n\r\n**Note for Windows**\r\n\r\nTo install Buzz from the releases section below, **download all three** Windows files (one `*.exe` and both `*.bin` files) and run the `*.exe`\r\nApp is not signed, you will get a warning when you install it. Select `More info` -> `Run anyway`.","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Buzz: Transcribe audio from your microphones in real-time using OpenAI's Whisper","url":"https://github.com/chidiwilliams/buzz","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=33278785","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2022-10-20","points":79,"comments":8},{"title":"Show HN: I made a GUI for OpenAI's Whisper","url":"https://github.com/chidiwilliams/buzz","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=33012066","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2022-09-28","points":6,"comments":0},{"title":"Buzz: Transcribe and translate audio offline on your personal computer","url":"https://github.com/chidiwilliams/buzz","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=39786677","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2024-03-22","points":1,"comments":0},{"title":"Buzz under Block adds Projects feature, positioned as a self-sovereign GitHub alternative","url":"https://www.binance.com/en/square/post/357316117814306","source":"binance","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-19"},{"title":"Block Rolls Out Buzz AI Collaboration Workspace","url":"https://sdtimes.com/open-source-ai/block-rolls-out-buzz-ai-collaboration-workspace/","source":"SD Times","lang":"en","date":"2026-07-23"},{"title":"Block l